{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1477.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"b9095ab2e17669445eed3c866f5f61abde4e300028b3ecef780c0be22a19271c","ja":"とっておきのネタは……","zh":"压箱底的料是……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1477.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"02c57f32166122b01d6fd4d4507d13cccab25f073e2c7eb62e90b4385a41107a","ja":"あの、私がクロエっぽい、というのは……。","zh":"那个，说我像克洛伊，是指……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1477.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"0b64fc1445c1acbb4d95402a013ac873fb960c3a4d8e12c7db205128494e6f96","ja":"「私は変わり者でも、個性的でもない普通の人間」\nという発言のこと、でしょうか？","zh":"“我既不是怪人，也不是有个性的人，只是个普通人”\n您指的是这句发言吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1477.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"b7300a23de689b77d86de25fcf26dd8555893da5f61b38dc08beea103431312a","ja":"うん。クロエも、\n自分は普通だって、思ってたでしょ。","zh":"嗯。克洛艾之前，\n也觉得自己很普通吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1477.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"62cbc5716b170d107883e1993d61c61490080d3694e90994a15a584f05ea6d97","ja":"（そう言えば以前に、「クロエも私も、\n自分のことが分かってない」と感じましたね……）","zh":"（说起来以前曾觉得，\n“克洛伊和我，都不了解自己呢”……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1477.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"8503da9f5abcccad73a90f94bb5c450cac83831629ba8832bfe02a6242a5ed8a","ja":"ではやはり、私は自覚していないだけで、\n『エキセントリック』なのでしょうか？","zh":"这么说来，果然只是我自己没有自觉，\n其实很“古怪”吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1477.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"9cc2f4ab36f6910d7396d02deabfa1903934182bc8b7072172703a5f53826520","ja":"う～ん……、\nそういうわけじゃないとは思うけど……。","zh":"嗯～……\n虽然我觉得应该不是那样……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1477.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"dd532e8f77214b05d23a7ad60d01f77528ba6faa8efafb7b821efbd158d23c55","ja":"でも、『変わったエピソード』くらい、\n気付いてないだけで、誰でもあると思うよ。","zh":"不过，“奇特的经历”这种事，\n我觉得只是自己没注意到，其实大家多多少少都会有吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1477.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"9db2388d916a75a098473524d69e976d80832bcee9ad4b344f1c8d5fdf27fa2b","ja":"●●●●プロデューサーも、紬のそういう\nところを見て、推薦したんじゃないかな？","zh":"●●●●制作人也是看到了紬的那种\n品质，才推荐她的吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1477.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"73f286a9a742300a67b4157c537e6089142f2c2cdbd2196b4807f8bb532ff1ac","ja":"なるほど、それでしたら……はっ！","zh":"原来如此，既然这样的话……啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1477.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"3c5c8252c9275135d67cf5bb7bf7e78cb2ad1c6861e41632ec8f14ad1a4e93f5","ja":"で、では、●●●●プロデューサーは、\n私の変わったところを放置して、笑っていたとっ！","zh":"那、这么说，●●●●制作人是\n明知我身上变了却不管，还在一边看笑话吗！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1477.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"80ef777f723b40c8241edda44bb6fd8a4e021ecf7a9e05ffbaf1fd8dba132275","ja":"やはり、納得できません！\n●●●●プロデューサーに抗議して参ります！","zh":"果然还是无法接受！\n我要去向●●●●制作人抗议！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1477.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"d5646ff4ddcc919172a3b390620b49b30c54832fd59ec6ab0e45f34ddd110314","ja":"ありゃ～……。\n紬さん、あっという間に行ってしまったね～。","zh":"哎呀～……。\n紬走得真快呢～……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1477.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"e9594886fef47ff254e137f8f77a07a79c42aa609cbf33859d9adeb27b30d75f","ja":"●●●●プロデューサー、紬さんの勘違いを\nよく指摘してたと思うんだけども……。","zh":"●●●●制作人，我记得你经常指出来\n紬小姐搞错的地方来着……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1477.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"2a7ae2028caab8b6f9e53a6d6a9e7527b77485baf8c26c73bf719de49e7cec71","ja":"あっ、いいこと思いついちゃったかも！","zh":"啊，我好像想到好主意了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1477.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"4a91d69640e6285af8f1ee44156878a1c62ef96e0a00e4d2026f18bea10a0b86","ja":"紬さんと●●●●プロデューサーさんのやりとりって、\n『私の変わったエピソード』になるんじゃないかな？","zh":"紬小姐和●●●●制作人之间的交流互动，\n算不算是“我的奇特小插曲”呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1477.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"5e3614802ccb94d1e1a67923d159fec4c2874e672075b2e7df48f9cf9bfad21a","ja":"紬さんが戻ってきたら、提案してみよ～っと♪","zh":"等紬小姐回来后，我就去向她提议看看吧～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
